<title>DENMARK: Kingdom of Sweden raises 4-pct 2004 bond amount.</title>
<headline>Kingdom of Sweden raises 4-pct 2004 bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kingdom of Sweden (Kongeriget Sverige) is raising the amount of its existing four percent bond due 2004 by 300 million crowns to 900 million Danish crowns, arranger ABN AMRO Hoare Govett said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969652</p>
